            <description><![CDATA[With the help of Mattia, the Plane Wiki has been updated. Click Read More to view the new changes.]]></description>
            <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>With the help of Mattia, the Plane Wiki has been updated. Click Read More to view the new changes.</p>
<p><strong>747-100</strong>, <strong>747-200</strong>, <strong>747-300</strong>, <strong>747-400</strong> and <strong>747-8</strong> have been added, as well as their F variants and their images.</p>
<p><img decoding="async" loading="lazy" alt="allahakbar" src="https://planewiki.lory.dev/assets/images/allahakbar-9362522695f691fda5c3730912862eff.jpeg" width="640" height="357" class="img_ev3q"></p>]]></content:encoded>
        </item>
